    "time": "2019-12-04",
    "abstract": "In e+e- collisions, the integrated luminosity is generally measured from the rate of low-angle Bhabha interactions. We present an updated and more accurate prediction of the Bhabha cross section, which reduces it by about 0.048% and its uncertainty to +-0.037%. The number of light neutrino species becomes N_nu = 2.9963 +- 0.0074.",
